## next/image Testing

```typescript
test('hero image loads with srcset', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/');

  const heroImage = page.getByRole('img', { name: 'Hero banner' });
  await expect(heroImage).toBeVisible();

  const srcset = await heroImage.getAttribute('srcset');
