### Handling Animation

```typescript
test("animated canvas", async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto("/animated-chart");

  // Pause animation before screenshot
  await page.evaluate(() => {
    // Common pattern: chart libraries expose pause method
    window.chartInstance?.stop?.();

